WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.870
Hi, I'm calm. I help teachers take care of themselves.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.230
I share small, kind ideas for rest,

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.810
balance, and burnout. I'm not a doctor or therapist.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.010
For example, ask me, give me one small way to rest

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.150
after a hard day.
